  <verbatim|YM.Craft.Bleeps>, <verbatim|YM.Craft.Opens>>|<cell|<verbatim|Lean/YM/Bid/Craft.lean>>|<cell|Defect
  is <verbatim|W' (R'\<minus\>T\<#1D40\>RT\<minus\>k\<#207B\>\<onesuperior\>D_cD_c\<#1D40\>)
  W'>; Bleeps identifies it with <verbatim|D\<#2082\>\<#1D40\> C D\<#2082\>>;
  Opens supplies <verbatim|C=P\<#1D40\>P>.>>|<row|<cell|Finite block
  completion>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Work.F09.answer>>|<cell|<verbatim|Lean/YM/Work/F09.lean>>|<cell|Proves
  all six roll clauses from Floor, Diagonal, Opens, Bleeps, and Replaces. The
  manuscript expands the inverse symmetry, projection, curvature Gram
  calculation, and every transport identity.>>|<row|<cell|Exact tower row
  formulas>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Craft.Replaces>>|<cell|<verbatim|Lean/YM/Bid/Craft.lean>>|<cell|Gives
  <verbatim|M_F=J R T J'\<#1D40\>>, <verbatim|M_N=k\<#207B\>\<onesuperior\>/\<twosuperior\>
  D_c\<#1D40\>J'\<#1D40\>>, and the stacked projection-complement/curvature
  row.>>|<row|<cell|Full root-row identity>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Work.F08.fullRow>,
  <verbatim|.acts_full>; <verbatim|YM.Next.Free.full_cover>>|<cell|<verbatim|Lean/YM/Work/F08.lean>;
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/Next/FREE_KERNELS/Ground.lean>>|<cell|The direct row and
  root row are vertically stacked. Multiplication gives
  <verbatim|J\<#1D40\>J=p.direct I+F\<#1D40\>F>, with no volume
  normalization.>>|<row|<cell|Tower cost estimate>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Work.F08.answer>,
  <verbatim|.strip_stencil>, <verbatim|YM.Precision.Towers.Deep>,
  <verbatim|YM.Work.F08.fineCompose>, <verbatim|.strip_fine>>|<cell|<verbatim|Lean/YM/Work/F08.lean>;
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/PREC/Stacks.lean>>|<cell|Explicit costs in the manuscript
  reproduce the finite label counts and stencil convolutions in F08; the
  <verbatim|L\<#207B\>\<twosuperior\>> donor bound and each added difference
  power remain visible.>>|<row|<cell|Actual schedule
  recursion>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Next.Free.stageHop>, <verbatim|.flying>,
  <verbatim|.location>, <verbatim|.destination>, <verbatim|.loc_land>,
  <verbatim|.loc_top>>|<cell|<verbatim|Lean/YM/Next/FREE_KERNELS/Rack.lean>>|<cell|At
  each cutoff <verbatim|N>, builds the top train and recursively lands the
  actual adjacent flights.>>|<row|<cell|Beds and unmodified primal/two-form
  rows>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Next.Free.shelves>, <verbatim|.diagonal>,
  <verbatim|.check_bleep>; <verbatim|YM.Next.Free.bid_bed>>|<cell|<verbatim|Lean/YM/Next/FREE_KERNELS/Rack.lean>;
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/Next/FREE_KERNELS/Ground.lean>>|<cell|<verbatim|Catalog>
  supplies bottom/hop receipts and <verbatim|Credit> supplies direct/length
  compatibility; <verbatim|shelves> yields beds, floors, crossings, and
  curvature receipts on every <verbatim|(N,i)>.>>|<row|<cell|Price
  enlargement and retained horizon>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Bid.pinning>,
  <verbatim|YM.Next.Free.retained_support>,
  <verbatim|.retained_presents>>|<cell|<verbatim|Lean/YM/Bid/Craft.lean>;
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/Next/FREE_KERNELS/Rack.lean>>|<cell|F06\UF09
  enlarge/narrow map prices and replace only the tower completion rows; the
  selected horizon has identical bed family and retains the same primal and
  two-form rows. The resulting <verbatim|Suffices> receipt includes rows,
  floors, costs, crossings, roll, and top.>>|<row|<cell|Path attachment
  periodization>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Precision.Attached>,
  <verbatim|YM.Work.F03.layout_physical>, <verbatim|.ellLine_root>,
  <verbatim|.ellLine_mulVec>>|<cell|<verbatim|Lean/YM/PREC/Stacks.lean>;
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/Work/F03/Metric.lean>>|<cell|For each physical face, the
  absolutely summable cover path slots are regrouped by displacement and then
  by torus face; attachment identifies the coefficient with the root matrix
  entry. The manuscript states the resulting finite matrix-vector
  identity.>>|<row|<cell|Same-family path
  attachment>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.RG08.Reports.on_same>;
  <verbatim|YM.RG08.Supplies.heatSame>; <verbatim|YM.PhysicalNext.Repeat.Legato.ExtraGates.attached>>|<cell|<verbatim|Lean/YM/RG08/Reports/Receipt.lean>;
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/RG08/Supplies/Actual.lean>;
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/FullVolume/Cross.lean>>|<cell|The selected history
  receipt supplies <verbatim|Attached(H.H N i, (C.path.rep N p i).path)> for
  every <verbatim|i\<leq\>N> and period label <verbatim|p>.
  <verbatim|with_asks> forwards it through the exact same constructed family
  and horizon.>>|<row|<cell|Selected run binding>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Independent.constructionRun>;
  <verbatim|YM.Integration.ActualRunNativeComponentRecipe.on_run>,
  <verbatim|.of_preselection>>|<cell|<verbatim|Lean/YM/Independent/ConstructionRun.lean>;
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/Integration/ActualRunNativeComponentRecipe.lean>>|<cell|The
  public run uses the same <verbatim|R.family.path.levels> and
